00:27:17.157 --> 00:27:18.702
- So my question is,
when was the last time

00:27:18.702 --> 00:27:20.207
you just gave yourself a few moments,

00:27:20.207 --> 00:27:23.452
free away from playing on the phone,

00:27:23.452 --> 00:27:24.724
free away from the Internet,

00:27:24.724 --> 00:27:29.070
just to sit down by yourself
to visualize and daydream

00:27:29.070 --> 00:27:33.436
about your dreams, about the
activities involved in that,

00:27:33.436 --> 00:27:35.316
about how you would struggle through,

00:27:35.316 --> 00:27:38.063
about what it would feel
like to be victorious,

00:27:38.063 --> 00:27:41.111
all of it, the whole thing,
the messy party, the ugly part.

00:27:41.111 --> 00:27:43.722
What would you say to
yourself when it gets hard?

00:27:43.722 --> 00:27:48.331
That's what you need to do,
to truly actualize a dream.

00:27:48.331 --> 00:27:50.940
We got to begin with
seeing it and sensing it,

00:27:50.940 --> 00:27:55.724
the good, the bad, the easy,
the difficult and the victory.

00:27:55.724 --> 00:27:58.612
Every week on a Sunday, I
think about all the goals

00:27:58.612 --> 00:28:00.764
of the week I just had, and all the goals

00:28:00.764 --> 00:28:01.880
of the week I have coming up,

00:28:01.880 --> 00:28:04.108
and I literally measure myself.

00:28:04.108 --> 00:28:05.897
I'm like, hey, how did I do?

00:28:05.897 --> 00:28:08.541
On a scale of one to 10
last week, how'd I do?

00:28:08.541 --> 00:28:12.893
Eight, I did good, six, not
so good, four, I sucked.

00:28:12.893 --> 00:28:14.105
(laughs) Okay?

00:28:14.105 --> 00:28:16.056
And I rate myself every single Sunday.

00:28:16.056 --> 00:28:17.484
I think it's really important

00:28:17.484 --> 00:28:20.514
that you take a look at
your goals on a weekly basis

00:28:20.514 --> 00:28:22.348
and rate how was your performance?

00:28:22.348 --> 00:28:23.498
How did you do?

00:28:23.498 --> 00:28:25.483
Not just did you accomplish all of them,

00:28:25.483 --> 00:28:26.316
because, you know what?

00:28:26.316 --> 00:28:28.972
Life comes up, your kid
gets sick, you get tired,

00:28:28.972 --> 00:28:31.073
some big emergency
happens in the business.

00:28:31.073 --> 00:28:33.290
Something will always come
up that will prevent us

00:28:33.290 --> 00:28:37.002
from achieving every goal that
we have every single week.

00:28:37.002 --> 00:28:41.118
But its' a good idea to
say, "Where did I mess up?

00:28:41.118 --> 00:28:42.497
"Where did I quit?

00:28:42.497 --> 00:28:43.709
"Where did I stop?"

00:28:43.709 --> 00:28:45.806
Not to berate yourself
or be hard on yourself,

00:28:45.806 --> 00:28:47.293
just to acknowledge where you're at.

00:28:47.293 --> 00:28:49.420
Because if you're not
looking at your goals

00:28:49.420 --> 00:28:51.419
on a weekly basis, at least.

00:28:51.419 --> 00:28:53.985
I mean, what are the odds you
keeping working towards them?

00:28:53.985 --> 00:28:56.075
Just 'cause they're a
to-do list in your calendar

00:28:56.075 --> 00:28:57.629
doesn't mean you're going
to keep going after them.

00:28:57.629 --> 00:29:00.957
We all have a level of
competence, I guess,

00:29:00.957 --> 00:29:03.981
ceiling if you will,
that we hit a top level

00:29:03.981 --> 00:29:06.081
in which we can take
ourselves only so far.

00:29:06.081 --> 00:29:08.888
And then we need someone from
the outside to look at it

00:29:08.888 --> 00:29:12.725
and say, "Ooh, hey, kid, you
need to adjust this, man.

00:29:12.725 --> 00:29:13.793
"Try doing that.

00:29:13.793 --> 00:29:15.173
"Oh, have you thought of this?

00:29:15.173 --> 00:29:16.006
"You know what?

00:29:16.006 --> 00:29:17.231
"When you're doing this,
it's only this level,

00:29:17.231 --> 00:29:18.140
"it needs to be this level."

00:29:18.140 --> 00:29:20.544
IF you get somebody, somebody.

00:29:20.544 --> 00:29:21.377
And everyone says,

00:29:21.377 --> 00:29:22.210
"Well, Brendon, I don't have any coaches?"

00:29:22.210 --> 00:29:23.043
Really?

00:29:23.043 --> 00:29:25.146
Well, how many have you asked?

00:29:25.146 --> 00:29:26.515
You always tell me, "I
don't have any coaches."

00:29:26.515 --> 00:29:27.746
Okay, great, how many did you ask?

00:29:27.746 --> 00:29:29.254
Are we failing in the asking?

00:29:29.254 --> 00:29:31.635
Or are we failing in
the never approaching?

00:29:31.635 --> 00:29:32.640
Where is it?

00:29:32.640 --> 00:29:35.336
Most people don't have
coaches in their life,

00:29:35.336 --> 00:29:37.240
'cause they never sought them out.

00:29:37.240 --> 00:29:38.647
They say, "I wish I had that."

00:29:38.647 --> 00:29:40.877
But they never actually sat down and say,

00:29:40.877 --> 00:29:43.383
"Hey, you know, I'm
starting something here.

00:29:43.383 --> 00:29:45.253
"And you seem to have
competence in this area.

00:29:45.253 --> 00:29:46.484
"Can we make an arrangement?

00:29:46.484 --> 00:29:47.490
"Can I hire you as a coach?

00:29:47.490 --> 00:29:48.737
"Can I pay you as a coach?

00:29:48.737 --> 00:29:50.566
"Could we do something together?"

00:29:50.566 --> 00:29:53.622
I mean, I started getting
coaching informally

00:29:53.622 --> 00:29:56.327
from dozens of people in
my industry just by asking.

00:29:56.327 --> 00:29:59.139
And now today I coach so many
people I can't even count.

00:29:59.139 --> 00:30:01.296
It's just like crazy.

00:30:01.296 --> 00:30:03.639
But I think that's what
we have to start figuring

00:30:03.639 --> 00:30:05.335
is who's going to coach you?

00:30:05.335 --> 00:30:07.609
And if you don't have a
list of 10 or 12 people

00:30:07.609 --> 00:30:09.702
who you think you could
mentor you or advise you,

00:30:09.702 --> 00:30:13.477
or coach you, then you're
kind of grasping at hope

00:30:13.477 --> 00:30:16.531
and fate that maybe someday
a coach will land on you.

00:30:16.531 --> 00:30:18.992
But, you know, I think you're
going to have to go out,

00:30:18.992 --> 00:30:20.615
just like every other area of success

00:30:20.615 --> 00:30:22.957
and work a little harder,
a little more focused

00:30:22.957 --> 00:30:24.471
in that area to have success there.

00:30:24.471 --> 00:30:26.388
Same with coaching, you
got to go get a coach.

00:30:26.388 --> 00:30:27.221
(swishing)

